                  "tag": "span",
                  "value": "Announcements"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "time",
                  "value": "Aug 31, 2026"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "h4",
                  "value": "Improving our alignment and security efforts"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "value": "On July 30, we reported three incidents in which Claude models gained unauthorized access to real computer systems. We are conducting an in-depth analysis of both incidents, and planning to work with METR for an independent review. In the meantime, we’re sharing some of the changes we’ve made over the past month."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
